Delete it!

597
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:36,880
I'm dying.

598
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:37,760
Wait.

599
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:39,940
(Goofs around)

600
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:42,880
You two do that.

601
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,280
Can I look prettier? Please?

602
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:49,580
(Cracks up)

603
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:52,360
Okay.

604
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,800
You're blocking each other.

605
00:18:58,360 --> 00:18:59,960
This is getting conceptual.

606
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:04,320
Are we doing some kung fu now?

607
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,640
This one's gonna be hilarious.

608
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:24,080
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

609
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:26,680
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

610
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:30,880
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

611
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:34,760
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

612
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:37,400
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

613
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:41,480
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

614
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,600
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

615
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:44,920
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

616
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,240
♪Love out loud♪

617
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,640
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

618
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,880
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

619
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,280
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

620
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:53,240
♪Just be a little braver♪

621
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,480
♪Keep moving♪

622
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:56,080
♪Keep moving♪

623
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:59,440
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

624
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:04,160
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

625
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:17,400
♪Keep moving♪

626
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:20,040
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

627
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:22,680
♪Go discover♪

628
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:25,360
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

629
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:28,040
♪Come closer♪

630
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:31,440
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

631
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:36,680
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪
